As you are aware, the recent discovery of newly mappable regions on the continent of Aurora presents an unprecedented opportunity for our great nation to expand its sphere of influence, secure vital resources, and assert its status as a dominant power. I write to present to you the compelling arguments in favor of engaging in the scramble for Aurora, thereby opening the continent to European civilization and safeguarding our interests from rival powers.
