2.  Humanely dispatch the turkey: You can use a sharp knife or a device specifically designed for dispatching animals. Hold the turkey firmly and make a swift, deep cut through the neck, keeping the blade parallel to the bird's body. This will help to quickly and humanely end the turkey's life. You can also consider consulting with a veterinarian or a experienced butcher for guidance on humane dispatch methods.
